_left_container_size < left_container_ms.width) {\n\trect.size.x -= left_container_ms.width - current_left_container_size;\n}\n```\n\nA screenshot difference to show what the problem i am talking about is :\n\nwith your code :\n<img width=\"359\" height=\"504\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a2356c6-fefa-4262-9aee-e8045f0615f5\" />\n\nwith what i suggest :\n\n<img width=\"376\" height=\"466\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9807e55-501d-491b-8165-f7452dd765ec\" />\n\n\nThere is still a difference with ltr but this seems like a localisation difference the add element button is larger in english then in arabic but the same difference exist between two different language that are both ltr:\n<img width=\"267\" height=\"341\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6998a5e8-2764-4b47-b862-f3e354460aa2\" />\n<img width=\"311\" height=\"340\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb91353d-0fb7-4be3-9956-7ae188cf2a58\" />\n\nMaybe for another PR we could have a reduced width button version that it would switch to when there is not enough space\n","created_at":"2026-09-19T11:57:02Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T11:57:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121703#discussion_r4053114389","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121703","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4053114389"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121703#discussion_r4053114389"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121703"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/4053114389/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":497,"original_start_line":472,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":502,"original_line":476,"side":"RIGHT","in_rep